  "description": "<p>This round rug is a vibrant and engaging educational tool designed to help children understand and express their emotions. Featuring a playful feeling wheel chart in a composition notebook style, it brings warmth and personality to learning spaces. It serves as a visual aid for emotional regulation, fostering mindfulness and healthy routines in a fun and interactive way.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Features a colorful feeling wheel chart for emotional learning.</li>\n<li>Designed to support emotional development and mindfulness.</li>\n<li>Adds warmth and personality with a playful composition notebook style.</li>\n<li>Made from high-quality polyester for comfort and durability.</li>\n<li>Functions as a seating mat, welcome mat, or calming corner rug.</li>\n<li>Helps children build emotional vocabulary and recognize different feelings.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Area Rug</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Round</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Flat Woven</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Indoor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Cartoon</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Emotional Learning</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Special Features</td>\n<td>Non Slip</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Faux Wool</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>Memory Foam</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Product Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Vacuum regularly or hand/machine wash with cold water</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This versatile rug is ideal for classrooms, therapy rooms, reading corners, and calming areas. It creates a supportive and emotionally aware environment, perfect for educational settings and play areas where children can learn about emotions.</p>",
